    ADDITION    
================

^^^ | Increment the A register to 3
~^^^^^ | Swap A/B register data and increment A to 5
@% | Combine both registers and do a numbered output of the A register

0~0 | Zero A/B registers for next code snippet

    SUBTRACTION     
====================

^^ | Increment the A register to 5
~^^^^^ | Swap A/B register data and increment A to 5
#% | Subtract B from A register and do a numbered output of the A register A = 3
